---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  lang="zh"
  title="产品 · ORDO"
  description="ORDO 产品体系：按可核对事实与边界能力组织的器具（硬件）与软件，用于中断后的回到这里。"
  keywords={["ORDO", "产品体系", "器具", "硬件", "软件", "RESPECTA", "回到这里", "re-entry"]}
>
  <section class="page">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="hero" aria-label="产品体系">
        <h1 class="h1">产品体系</h1>
        <p class="lead">按规则能力组织：边界确认 / 责任事实 / 回溯事实。</p>
        <p class="note">
          ORDO 的器具不是提醒系统，也不替你做判断。它们把关键规则落成<strong>可核对事实</strong>，让你在中断与切换之后仍能回到自己的判断位置。
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions" aria-label="相关入口">
          <a class="btn" href="/zh/shop">硬件商城</a>
          <a class="btn" href="/zh/software">软件</a>
          <a class="btn" href="/zh/manufacturing">制造与核对</a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="/zh/releases">发布记录</a>
        </div>
      <p class="jump">
          快速定位：
          <a class="inline" href="#tiers">体系分层</a> ·
          <a class="inline" href="#families">产品家族</a> ·
          <a class="inline" href="#redlines">范式红线</a>
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <section class="section" id="tiers" aria-label="体系分层">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 class="h2">体系分层</h2>
          <p class="sublead">以“规则能力”分层，而不是以功能堆叠分组。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-4" role="list" aria-label="体系分层">
          <article class="card tier" role="listitem">
            <div class="no" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
            <div class="tier-head">
              <div class="tier-cn">事实层</div>
              <div class="tier-en">Facts</div>
            </div>
            <p class="p">把关键状态外显为事实：你能看到、能回到、能核对。</p>
          </article>

          <article class="card tier" role="listitem">
            <div class="no" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
            <div class="tier-head">
              <div class="tier-cn">场景层</div>
              <div class="tier-en">Scenes</div>
            </div>
            <p class="p">把事实组织为可部署场景：阅读、工作、交接、复现等；不改变判断，只保留边界。</p>
          </article>

          <article class="card tier" role="listitem">
            <div class="no" aria-hidden="true">03</div>
            <div class="tier-head">
              <div class="tier-cn">组织层</div>
              <div class="tier-en">Orgs</div>
            </div>
            <p class="p">把场景稳定为共同语言：在团队/家庭中仍能保持一致的边界与责任事实。</p>
          </article>

          <article class="card tier" role="listitem">
            <div class="no" aria-hidden="true">04</div>
            <div class="tier-head">
              <div class="tier-cn">标准层</div>
              <div class="tier-en">Standards</div>
            </div>
            <p class="p">标准文本用于阅读与核对；不构成对任何产品的自动背书。</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <section class="section" id="families" aria-label="产品家族">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 class="h2">产品家族</h2>
          <p class="sublead">用“可核对事实”组织三类典型场景。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-3" role="list" aria-label="产品家族">
          <article class="card" role="listitem">
            <div class="card-head">
              <div class="k">边界事实系统</div>
              <div class="mini">停止位 / 下一步 / 已交接</div>
            </div>
            <p class="p">让“停止位 / 下一步 / 已交接”变成事实锚点，方便回到同一判断位置。</p>
            <div class="tags" aria-label="适用场景">
              <span class="tag">阅读</span><span class="tag">写作</span><span class="tag">沟通</span><span class="tag">交接</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="list">
              <li>被打断后想迅速回到原位置</li>
              <li>任务切换频繁但不想重建上下文</li>
            </ul>
          </article>

          <article class="card" role="listitem">
            <div class="card-head">
              <div class="k">责任事实系统</div>
              <div class="mini">已履行 / 已交接 / 已关闭</div>
            </div>
            <p class="p">把“已履行 / 已交接 / 已关闭”变成事实，而不是提醒与追责。</p>
            <div class="tags" aria-label="适用场景">
              <span class="tag">家庭责任</span><span class="tag">照护事项</span><span class="tag">维护任务</span><span class="tag">协作交接</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="list">
              <li>把责任落到现实，而不是落到口头承诺</li>
              <li>明确“谁已完成 / 何时完成 / 是否可核对”</li>
            </ul>
          </article>

          <article class="card" role="listitem">
            <div class="card-head">
              <div class="k">回溯事实系统</div>
              <div class="mini">上次发生 / 上次确认 / 复现依据</div>
            </div>
            <p class="p">把“上次发生 / 上次确认 / 复现依据”变成事实锚点。</p>
            <div class="tags" aria-label="适用场景">
              <span class="tag">创作</span><span class="tag">专业工作</span><span class="tag">复盘</span><span class="tag">经验复现</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="list">
              <li>把关键依据留在现实中，便于回到同一判断位置</li>
              <li>跨时间复现决策背景，而不依赖记忆</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <section class="section" id="redlines" aria-label="范式红线">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 class="h2">范式红线</h2>
          <p class="sublead">不监控、不评分、不惩罚、不强提醒。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="quote" role="note">
          <p>
            ORDO 的产品不以监控、评分、惩罚、强提醒为成立基础。器具不驱动你做决定，只在你需要时提供可靠参照。
          </p>
          <p class="quote-foot">你不在场时它保持沉默；你回来时它仍然准确。</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    /* Align with Manufacturing page layout */

    .hero{ padding-top: 10px; max-width: 104ch; }

    .lead{ margin: 12px 0 0; color: rgba(220,235,240,.78); line-height: 1.85; max-width: 92ch; }

    .hero-actions{ margin-top: 14px; display:flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.note{ margin: 12px 0 0; color: rgba(220,235,240,.60); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.75; max-width: 104ch; }
    .jump{ margin: 10px 0 0; color: rgba(220,235,240,.56); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.75; }
    .inline{ color: rgba(240,252,255,0.92); text-underline-offset: 2px; }

    .section{ margin-top: 14px; }
    .section-head{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-end; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    .sublead{ margin: 6px 0 0; color: rgba(220,235,240,0.66); line-height: 1.75; max-width: 110ch; }

    .card-head{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-end; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .k{ font-weight: 800; color: rgba(240,252,255,0.92); letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-size: 12px; }
    .mini{ margin-top: 6px; font-size: 12px; color: rgba(220,235,240,.60); }
    .p{ margin: 10px 0 0; color: rgba(220,235,240,.74); line-height: 1.85; }
    /* Desktop layout: keep all three blocks visually consistent */
    .grid-3{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-top: 12px; }
    .grid-3 > article{ min-height: 260px; }
    /* Third card sits on its own row but keeps the same width/height as the others */
    .grid-3 > article:nth-child(3){
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      width: calc((100% - 12px) / 2);
      max-width: none;
      justify-self: center;
    }
    .grid-4{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-top: 12px; }

    .tier .no{
      position:absolute;
      top: 12px;
      right: 14px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: rgba(220,235,240,0.24);
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    }
    .tier-head{ display:flex; gap: 10px; align-items: baseline; margin-top: 2px; }
    .tier-cn{ font-weight: 780; color: rgba(240,252,255,0.92); }
    .tier-en{ font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: rgba(220,235,240,0.52); }

    .tags{ margin-top: 10px; display:flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .tag{
      padding: 5px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(220,235,240,0.10);
      background: rgba(10,22,26,0.10);
      color: rgba(220,235,240,0.70);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .list{ margin: 12px 0 0; padding-left: 18px; color: rgba(220,235,240,.70); line-height: 1.75; }
    .list li{ margin: 6px 0; }

    .quote{
      margin-top: 12px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(220,235,240,0.10);
      background: rgba(10,22,26,0.10);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 34px rgba(0,0,0,0.30), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      padding: 16px;
      color: rgba(220,235,240,0.80);
      line-height: 1.9;
    }
    .quote p{ margin: 0; }
    .quote p + p{ margin-top: 10px; }
    .quote-foot{ color: rgba(240,252,255,0.90); }

    @media (max-width: 1100px){
      .grid-4{ grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr)); }
      .grid-3{ grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr)); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 780px){
      .grid-3{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .grid-3 > article:nth-child(3){ grid-column: auto; width: auto; justify-self: stretch; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 680px){

      .grid-4{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</Base>
